# More Bookshelf Variants — Minecraft 26.3 port (Fabric)

Port of [LieOnLion's More Bookshelf Variants](https://github.com/lieonlion/More-Bookshelf-Variants)
to Minecraft 26.3, with a Poplar bookshelf added.

## Changes
- Updated to the 26.x API
- Added the Poplar Bookshelf
- Pale Oak bookshelves are now flammable
- Advancements converted to the 26.3 format
- Turkish translation added
- A bug in Polish translation fixed
- Fixed an issue with loot_tables. Bookshelves now drop themselves with silk touch and drop 3 books when broken normally or survive an explosion.

## About Quad
The original mod depends on [Quad](https://modrinth.com/mod/quad), which has not been
released for 26.3. This port therefore does not require Quad. Without it:
- Bookshelves are not registered as furnace fuel through Quad's tags
- Crimson and Warped bookshelf item drops are not made fire-proof
- Vanilla bookshelves are not replaced inside generated structures

Everything else (blocks, recipes, drops, burning) works without it. The data files
for these features are still included and will take effect if Quad is updated.

## Testing
Tested on 26.3 with Fabric Loader 0.19.5 and Fabric API 0.164.0

